Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 06:58:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 44/45] A party-wide Exp. Share as a challenge rule

The rules woman in the player's house gets a third choice, Share experience,
kept in VAR_UNK_416E and off in a new game. With it on, Pokemon that didn't
battle get half the experience they would have had for beating the foe alone,
as in the games since X and Y. Made by tools/hack/party_exp_share.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
